    "Use baseline-v0-cade14d for every harness trial.",
    "Use glm-5.3-flash for user and harness, and glm-5.3 for design/developer.",
    "Run direct and simulated_user with the same task membership.",
    "Run harness, user simulator, designer, and developer inside Harbor with Boyue; do not use OpenRouter fallback."
